{"4117440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Trailer Incident", "steam_appid": 4117440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Trailer Incident</strong> is an atmospheric first-person horror set in 1980s America.<br>You find yourself inside a small <strong>RV</strong> hidden deep within the woods. It’s quiet — only the wind, the rain, and the soft crackle of an old TV.<br>But when strange lights appear in the sky, the silence turns into unease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The night grows longer, the radio picks up strange signals, objects move on their own, and someone — or something — is walking outside.<br>No weapons. No contact with the outside world. Only the beam of your flashlight and your nerves.<br>Explore the RV and its surroundings, search for answers, and ask the right questions — just to make it through the night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 A tense atmosphere of isolation, fear, and the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117440/extras/f08c8ae552d05b926648ecc4327d8eb1.poster.avif?t=1769598163\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117440/extras/f08c8ae552d05b926648ecc4327d8eb1.webm?t=1769598163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117440/extras/f08c8ae552d05b926648ecc4327d8eb1.mp4?t=1769598163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>🕯️ Explore and interact within a confined space: the RV, the forest, and everything around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>☕ Sleep and wake mechanics — find coffee, brew it, and stay awake before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_i